    {
      "id": "paragraph-129672-explanation",
      "revision": 1,
      "paragraphId": 129672,
      "sourceSha256": "a449547455bf4c770ecdbda5cea7c36a18e7880cc1edbf9212f6b67dd22e43f8",
      "sourceText": "齊田和會魏文侯、楚人、衛人于濁澤，求為諸侯。魏文侯為之請於王及諸侯，王許之。",
      "translation": "齐国田和与魏文侯、楚国人、卫国人在浊泽会盟，请求成为诸侯。魏文侯替他向周王和诸侯请求，周王答应了。",
      "reviewStatus": "unreviewed",
      "aiLabel": "AI生成·未经人工审校",
      "basis": {
        "kind": "source-text",
        "paragraphId": 129672
      },
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "paragraph-129681-explanation",
      "revision": 1,
      "paragraphId": 129681,
      "sourceSha256": "49edb2d163a49dde3a912dcb9a3e8b03923519d36c039683e63314b1ee5a1b2c",
      "sourceText": "趙公子朝作亂，出奔魏，與魏襲邯鄲，不克。",
      "translation": "赵国公子朝发动叛乱，逃到魏国，又与魏国一起袭击邯郸，没有攻克。",
      "reviewStatus": "unreviewed",
      "aiLabel": "AI生成·未经人工审校",
      "basis": {
        "kind": "source-text",
        "paragraphId": 129681
      },
      "notes": []
    },
    {
      "id": "paragraph-129684-explanation",
      "revision": 1,
      "paragraphId": 129684,
      "sourceSha256": "7d9fe46e08d09ab8b4151d8c0616e83f782affb541df029068e59bee1c2e5c17",
      "sourceText": "韓伐鄭，取陽城；伐宋，執宋〔悼〕公，〔國人立子休公田〕。",
      "translation": "韩国攻打郑国，夺取阳城；又攻打宋国，俘虏宋悼公，宋国人拥立他的儿子休公田。",
      "reviewStatus": "unreviewed",
      "aiLabel": "AI生成·未经人工审校",
      "basis": {
        "kind": "source-text",
        "paragraphId": 129684
      },
      "notes": [
